<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
    .header { {{#if primaryColor}}background: {{primaryColor}};{{else}}background: #059669;{{/if}} color: white; padding: 24px; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 24px; }
    {{#if merchantLogo}}
    .logo { max-width: 120px; max-height: 60px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    {{/if}}
    .body { background: #fff; padding: 24px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-top: none; border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px; }
    .amount { font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; {{#if primaryColor}}color: {{primaryColor}};{{else}}color: #059669;{{/if}} text-align: center; margin: 16px 0; }
    .details { background: #f9fafb; border-radius: 6px; padding: 16px; margin: 16px 0; }
    .details dt { font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 8px; }
    .details dd { margin: 2px 0 0 0; }
    .footer { text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af; margin-top: 24px; padding-top: 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; }
    .footer a { color: {{#if primaryColor}}{{primaryColor}}{{else}}#4F46E5{{/if}}; text-decoration: none; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      {{#if merchantLogo}}
      <img src="{{merchantLogo}}" alt="{{merchantName}}" class="logo">
      {{/if}}
      <h1>Pago confirmado</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <p>Hola{{#if payerName}} {{payerName}}{{/if}},</p>
      <p>Tu pago a <strong>{{merchantName}}</strong> se ha confirmado correctamente.</p>
      <div class="amount">{{formattedAmount}}</div>
      <dl class="details">
        <dt>ID del pago</dt>
        <dd>{{paymentId}}</dd>
        {{#if paymentDescription}}<dt>Descripción</dt>
        <dd>{{paymentDescription}}</dd>{{/if}}
        <dt>Fecha</dt>
        <dd>{{date}}</dd>
      </dl>
      <p>Gracias por tu pago. Si tienes alguna pregunta, ponte en contacto con el comercio.</p>
      {{#if supportUrl}}
      <p>Visita el <a href="{{supportUrl}}">soporte de {{merchantName}}</a> para obtener ayuda.</p>
      {{/if}}
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>&copy; {{year}} {{merchantName}}. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
      {{#if supportUrl}}<p><a href="{{supportUrl}}">Panel</a>{{/if}} | <a href="{{unsubscribeUrl}}">Cancelar suscripción</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
